OL,3,AFormer Australian bishop jailed for
OL,4,Asexually abusing young men
OL,5,
OL,6,FFormer Australian bishop Christopher
OL,7,FSaunders has been jailed for sexually
OL,8,Fabusing two young Aboriginal men during
OL,9,Fhis time as a Catholic cleric.
OL,11,FSaunders - who resigned as Bishop of
OL,12,FBroome when first accused of wrongdoing
OL,13,Fin 2020 - was found guilty of one
OL,14,Fcharge of rape and 12 counts of
OL,15,Findecent assault in August.
OL,17,FThe 76-year-old was on Wednesday
OL,18,Fsentenced to six and a half years in
OL,19,Fprison, but will be eligible for
OL,20,Frelease on parole in February 2031.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
